  "@type": "SemioticProjection",
  "instance_name": "semiotic_projection_1",
  "label": "User projected onto the exclusionary statement scene",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the exclusionary statement scene, which includes the visual material of the Black woman and the textual material stating 'i say woman of color because i want to be inclusive of all but white women.' The meme invites the user to identify with or internalize the perspective of the speaker, who is using the term 'woman of color' in a deliberately exclusionary way. The user is implicitly invited to see themselves as the speaker, adopting the stance of someone who uses the term to exclude white women, thereby projecting their own identity onto the scene and the text.",
